                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198274421127",
                            "num_reviews": 42,
                            "playtime_forever": 1540,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 1540,
                            "deck_playtime_at_review": 1540,
                            "last_played": 1780592535
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "7/10, pretty fun game if you like creating some pixel arts. I played the heck out of Cladun X2 on the PSP and this is basically the same game with more content. \n\nIt's lightning fast to pick up and do a dungeon run for some loots and upgrades, good timekiller and a perfect fit on the Steam Deck. The main campaign is pretty quick to run through, most of the gameplay is in getting RNG to give you better and better loots to make numbers go bigger which may get really repetitive really fast, so if you're not into that style of progression this series might be for you.\n\nOther reviews said there were stability issues with random crashes, but I haven't encountered any in my 25 hours playtime. There's no autosave though so do be careful.\n\nWorth getting on a sale, though I don't think there's any reason to get X2 if you want to get this, and it's probably the same way with X3, no reason to get this if you already have that one.\n",
